      "amount": "1/4 tsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "fresh parsley",
      "amount": "1 tbsp",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a stone bowl until shimmering.",
    "Add the minced garlic and diced onion and sauté until the onion turns translucent.",
    "Stir in the tomato puree and smoked paprika until the mixture smells fragrant.",
    "Pour in the white wine and let it reduce for 1 minute, then add the fish stock and bay leaf.",
    "Add the cod pieces, season with salt and pepper, cover and simmer on low heat for 10 minutes until the fish is opaque and flaky.",
    "Remove the bay leaf and stir in the chopped parsley.",
    "Serve the stew hot straight from the stone bowl for a rustic brunch experience.",
    "Optionally drizzle a splash of extra virgin olive oil before serving."
  ],
